lles</li>\r\n	<li>Prospection toujours en cours</li>\r\n	<li>Vid&eacute;o en pr&eacute;paration</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Divers</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>AG COPRO a eu lieu r&eacute;cemment : CR dispo &agrave; l&#39;entr&eacute;e</li>\r\n	<li>Showroom de l&#39;innovation &agrave; Besan&ccedil;on : AA souhaite t il participer?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<p><strong>RH/Recrutement :</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Arriv&eacute;e r&eacute;cente de Gauthier</li>\r\n	<li>Les entretiens professionnels avancent, &agrave; l&#39;issue un bilan sera dress&eacute;, et le plan de formation 2025-2026 &eacute;labor&eacute;</li>\r\n	<li>Fiches de postes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Fili&egrave;res num&eacute;riques :</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Cooptech\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>Cotisation 2025 = 1 766.67&euro; (0.18% de la VA)</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#2980b9\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>DAD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Calcul du financement du Logiciel libre = 1% de la VA</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\">\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" id=\"magicdomid13\">\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Pour = 4</li>\r\n	<li>Contre = 7</li>\r\n	<li>Abstention = 1</li>\r\n	<li>Blanc = 0</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>=&gt; une nouvelle proposition de m&eacute;thode de calcul devra &ecirc;tre propos&eacute;e</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\">\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" id=\"magicdomid12\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>Panda du mois</strong></span></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" id=\"magicdomid12\">\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\"><strong>Mot du Panda</strong> : LF = mur d&#39;id&eacute;es positives</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ace-line\" id=\"magicdomid13\"><strong>Tirage au sort : </strong>C&eacute;line</div>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Petit Dej de l&#39;innovation </strong>: non pr&eacute;vu</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n